WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.943 --> 00:00:16.004
that controller?"

2
00:00:17.485 --> 00:00:19.787
Wukong hurried around inside Meltron's head.

3
00:00:20.988 --> 00:00:22.709
Finally he got tired of searching.

4
00:00:22.729 --> 00:00:25.191
"I'll just break lots of things!"

5
00:00:26.552 --> 00:00:27.834
Wham! Smash!

6
00:00:28.995 --> 00:00:30.456
Wukong kicked and punched.

7
00:00:31.416 --> 00:00:32.617
He swung his iron bar.

8
00:00:33.918 --> 00:00:35.639
Meltron's parts shattered and broke.

9
00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:40.903
As Roxy and Cozlin fought with robots, they noticed something odd.

10
00:00:40.923 --> 00:00:45.726
"Meltron is acting funny," Cozlin said.

11
00:00:46.687 --> 00:00:49.769
The enormous robot moved in all sorts of strange ways.

12
00:00:50.709 --> 00:00:51.410
Roxy blinked.

13
00:00:51.430 --> 00:00:53.671
"Is he dancing?"

14
00:00:53.691 --> 00:00:56.193
"Silly, him!"

15
00:00:56.513 --> 00:00:57.154
Bippo said.

16
00:00:57.174 --> 00:00:59.936
"What's happening to me?"

17
00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:03.982
Meltron moaned.

18
00:01:05.404 --> 00:01:07.605
Wukong laughed.

19
00:01:08.326 --> 00:01:10.448
"I'm practicing my martial arts skills!"

20
00:01:11.689 --> 00:01:13.530
He did a flip and kicked another object.

21
00:01:14.992 --> 00:01:16.253
Meltron's eyes flickered.

22
00:01:16.633 --> 00:01:18.314
"This is fun!"

23
00:01:19.335 --> 00:01:21.737
Smash! Wukong kicked something else.

24
00:01:22.658 --> 00:01:24.199
A robot zoomed toward Roxy.

25
00:01:25.521 --> 00:01:29.023
She was about to punch it when it suddenly fell and splashed into the lava.

26
00:01:32.996 --> 00:01:36.059
Cozlin cheered as all the other robots instantly fell.

27
00:01:36.079 --> 00:01:38.981
"Wukong destroyed the controller!"

28
00:01:39.001 --> 00:01:40.923
"Your Majesty!"

29
00:01:41.183 --> 00:01:41.883
an official said.

30
00:01:41.903 --> 00:01:47.188
"A report from outside—all of the robots stopped moving!"

31
00:01:48.649 --> 00:01:50.110
King Radnik's eyes lit up.

32
00:01:50.570 --> 00:01:54.554
"Wonderful!" Flix looked at the ceiling.

33
00:01:54.574 --> 00:01:56.655
"The rumbling stopped.

34
00:01:56.916 --> 00:01:58.557
The robots stopped drilling!"

35
00:01:58.577 --> 00:02:02.040
"Hooray!" another Hulzarian said.

36
00:02:02.924 --> 00:02:03.744
"We're safe!"

37
00:02:05.265 --> 00:02:08.606
Wukong leaped out of Meltron's head and returned to his normal size.

38
00:02:10.386 --> 00:02:11.967
The enormous robot made a fist.

39
00:02:13.287 --> 00:02:15.088
"How dare you do that!

40
00:02:16.068 --> 00:02:18.448
Do you know how powerful I am?"

41
00:02:19.829 --> 00:02:20.769
Wukong snorted.

42
00:02:20.789 --> 00:02:23.130
"You're not as powerful as I am!

43
00:02:23.150 --> 00:02:27.551
Did you know the Jade Emperor is afraid of me?"

44
00:02:29.352 --> 00:02:30.492
Meltron tilted his head.

45
00:02:33.204 --> 00:02:35.186
"I don't even know who that is!"

46
00:02:36.987 --> 00:02:40.589
Zap! A laser shot from Cozlin's hand and hit Meltron.

47
00:02:41.530 --> 00:02:43.471
It left a burn mark on the robot's face.

48
00:02:44.572 --> 00:02:48.615
Wukong leaped high over the robot and swung his iron bar down—hard.

49
00:02:49.255 --> 00:02:52.558
Clang! The bar dented Meltron's head.

50
00:02:53.398 --> 00:02:56.620
The robot staggered backward, accidentally stepping into the lava.

51
00:02:56.640 --> 00:02:59.602
"Gah!" Meltron cried.

52
00:03:01.844 --> 00:03:05.626
Whiz-hoo! Roxy shot her eye laser beams, blasting off a chunk of Meltron's shoulder.

53
00:03:06.826 --> 00:03:08.087
Zap! Zap!

54
00:03:09.047 --> 00:03:12.329
Cozlin flew past Meltron's face, firing her lasers.

55
00:03:14.509 --> 00:03:16.310
Meltron swatted her with his hand.

56
00:03:17.051 --> 00:03:18.651
Cozlin slipped right through the hand.

57
00:03:19.111 --> 00:03:23.373
Shloomp! She emerged on the other side and fired another laser.

58
00:03:23.653 --> 00:03:29.316
Zap! By now smoke was pouring out of Meltron in several places.

59
00:03:30.620 --> 00:03:32.261
Sparks shot from dangling wires.

60
00:03:33.762 --> 00:03:35.443
The huge robot could barely walk.

61
00:03:36.624 --> 00:03:38.084
He pressed a button on his chest.

62
00:03:39.385 --> 00:03:41.446
An energy field suddenly filled the room.

63
00:03:47.110 --> 00:03:49.811
Dr. Odd and Terrell were listening on a communication device.

64
00:03:51.452 --> 00:03:53.093
Suddenly the sound became static.

65
00:03:55.374 --> 00:03:56.215
Terrell gasped.

66
00:03:56.995 --> 00:03:57.736
"What happened?"

67
00:03:59.732 --> 00:04:01.594
Roxy and Cozlin fell onto the walkway.

68
00:04:02.735 --> 00:04:03.996
Bippo hung on to Roxy.

69
00:04:04.016 --> 00:04:06.458
"Oof!" Roxy said.

70
00:04:07.779 --> 00:04:09.920
Wukong jumped up and ran toward Meltron.

71
00:04:11.261 --> 00:04:14.644
The big robot was moving slowly, but he managed to hit Wukong.

72
00:04:17.506 --> 00:04:19.608
The monkey stumbled backward, off the walkway.

73
00:04:21.049 --> 00:04:24.572
Cozlin grabbed him as Meltron opened a large door and stepped outside.

74
00:04:26.294 --> 00:04:29.136
Roxy tried to fire her eye laser beams, but nothing happened.

75
00:04:30.716 --> 00:04:32.397
"Our powers are gone again!

76
00:04:32.937 --> 00:04:34.277
What are we going to do?"

77
00:04:34.297 --> 00:04:39.358
"I'll tell you what you're going to do," Meltron said.

78
00:04:39.378 --> 00:04:45.820
"You're going to be trapped in here as this entire place self-destructs!"

79
00:04:47.481 --> 00:04:48.741
The door slid shut.

80
00:04:50.201 --> 00:04:51.742
Lava began to bubble violently.

81
00:04:53.062 --> 00:04:53.962
The room shook.

82
00:04:55.023 --> 00:04:58.244
Roxy ran back to the door they'd entered through.

83
00:04:58.264 --> 00:05:00.760
She tried to force it open, but it wouldn't budge.

84
00:05:02.505 --> 00:05:03.328
Roxy gulped.

85
00:05:03.348 --> 00:05:05.755
"We're trapped!"
